<title>UK: UK's Kwik Save names Smith trade director.</title>
<headline>UK's Kwik Save names Smith trade director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British food retail chain Kwik Save Group Plc said on Thursday it had given its group marketing director Philip Smith the additional responsibility of looking after its buying activities.</p>
<p>Smith will assume the title of group trading director, Kwik Save said.</p>
<p>The group's board also appointed Ronald Stanley as deputy chairman and the chairman of its audit committee with effect from August 31.</p>
